OL,3,GNEWSACalls for Knotty Ash tribute to
OL,4,A'comedy genius'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA close friend of legendary Liverpool
OL,7,Fcomic Sir Ken Dodd is calling for a
OL,8,Fpermanent memorial to be erected to him
OL,9,Fin the place he called home.
OL,11,FJohn Martin, a comedian from Bootle,
OL,12,Fsaid he would like to see either a
OL,13,Fstatue of the comedian in Knotty Ash,
OL,14,For his name on signs welcoming people
OL,15,Fto the Liverpool suburb.
OL,17,FSir Ken, who died aged 90 in 2018,
OL,18,Flived on Thomas Lane all of his life
OL,19,Fand would often reference his
OL,20,Fbirthplace in his routines.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
