OL,3,GNEWSACalls for Knotty Ash tribute to
OL,4,A'comedy genius'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin, who wrote jokes and material
OL,7,Ffor the comedian for more than three
OL,8,Fdecades, described Sir Ken as "an
OL,9,Fabsolute comedy genius". Liverpool City
OL,10,FCouncil has been approached for
OL,11,Fcomment.
